<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`answerRemovals` checks the count the person read, then restores each file from the records or removes each carrier through the delete door, raising a kāpae only over a lower copy, and reads the removal back from the view. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

